{"id":"574139400","kind":"article","title":"解释学","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Explanation_science"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"认知基石 & 教育培训","date":"2022-10-16","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":16,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":456,"keywords":["解释学","数学教育","教学设计","例子","文字解释"],"summary":"作者把“解释学”理解为研究如何写好解释的领域，并以数学例子说明，分类“例子”的框架可帮助写作者检查解释是否包含必要类型。与把教学视为传递既定内容不同，这种视角把解释看作可训练、可继续发展的技能。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/574139400","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"参见"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"jaIQBWRQ\">「解释学」是我经常会遇到的一个词。我觉得写好解释是门学问。</p><p data-pid=\"vFzizW3d\">我认为这篇文章（诚然，是我写的）很好地说明了我用「解释学」表示的范畴：<a class=\"external\" href=\"https://learning.subwiki.org/wiki/Examples_in_mathematics\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"visible\">learning.subwiki.org/wi</span><span class=\"invisible\">ki/Examples_in_mathematics</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>。这篇文章深入考察了「例子」这个概念，并提出了一套分类法。这样一来，如果有人在写数学解释材料，他就可以用这套方法，保证解释里完整具备四种例子。</p><p data-pid=\"payLRbZ0\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Comparison_of_pedagogical_scenes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">对比其他教学法</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>，解释学的观点是，解释是一项技能，我们能提高这项技能的水平，并发现更多新技术。</p><h3 id=\"sec-1\">参见</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"mijDPQIQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/We_still_don't_know_how_to_systematically_write_great_word_explanations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我们仍然不知道系统性撰写优质文字解释的方法</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"xH85XFIJ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Word_explanations_are_already_great\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">文字解释已经很不错了</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup><br/> </li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-2\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"6YvI5_Kl\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/List_of_AI_safety_projects_I_could_work_on\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我能着手的 AI 安全项目</a> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=List+of+AI+safety+projects+I+could+work+on\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← 链接</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"JdKemQ-8\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Word_explanations_are_already_great\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">文字解释已经很不错了</a>  (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Word+explanations+are+already+great\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← 链接</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"tikzaFnG\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/We_still_don't_know_how_to_systematically_write_great_word_explanations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我们仍然不知道系统性撰写优质文字解释的方法</a> (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=We+still+don't+know+how+to+systematically+write+great+word+explanations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← 链接</a>)<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"R8lYN5bM\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/What_makes_a_word_explanation_good?\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">好的文字解释有什么特点？</a>  (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=What+makes+a+word+explanation+good?\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">←链接</a>）<br/> </li><li data-pid=\"7SZKzUC4\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Comparison_of_pedagogical_scenes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">教学场景对比</a> (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Comparison+of+pedagogical+scenes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">←链接</a>)</li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"9ijOe5P7\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 <a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"c61647cbe94108837daef059482bd35e\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$c61647cbe94108837daef059482bd35e\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/c61647cbe94108837daef059482bd35e\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@Shom</a> <br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Explanation_science\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Explanation science</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 数学中的例子 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1944437942966789886\" href=\"#/post/1944437942966789886\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 比较教学场景 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"714263767\" href=\"#/post/714263767\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 我们仍然不知道系统性撰写优质文字解释的方法 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"657707474\" href=\"#/post/657707474\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 文字解释已经很不错了 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"591159393\" href=\"#/post/591159393\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"573838070","title":"迁移恰当加工","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":11,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"579476637","title":"记忆的双组分模型","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"60245776